ffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715309, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题二", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 3, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 3, "source": "模拟题二", "starCount": 0, "title": "B.M.Trost 1991年提出了原子经济的概念：若所有反应物均全部转化为欲得的产物，则此反应就是100%的原子经济反应。对于加成、取代和消去三种反应类型而言，其中最具有原子经济反应潜力的应是______ 反应。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715309, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 23}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【答案】乙烯;氯乙烷<br><br>【考情点拨】本题考查了确定物质的化学式的知识点。<br><br>【应试指导】由于烯烃的通式为CnH2n,已知0.1摩烯烃能生成0.2摩CO2,则说明n=2,是乙烯。<br>乙烯可与氯化氢发生加成反应：<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S105.png' />", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715310, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题二", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 6, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 6, "source": "模拟题二", "starCount": 0, "title": "完全燃烧0.1mol某烯烃X,生成0.2mol二氧化碳。在一定条件下，X跟氯化氢反应生成Y。X为______；Y为______。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715310, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 24}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S106.png' />", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715311, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题二", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 3, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 3, "source": "模拟题二", "starCount": 0, "title": "写出下列化学反应的离子方程式并配平：<br>FeS和稀硫酸反应制取硫化氢气体：______。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715311, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 25}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【答案】苍白;淡蓝<br>【考情点拨】本题考查了气体的化学性质的知识点。<br>【应试指导】根据物质的性质及实验现象可得。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715312, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题二", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 6, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 6, "source": "模拟题二", "starCount": 0, "title": "通常情况下，钠在空气中燃烧火焰呈黄色；氢气在氯气中燃烧火焰呈______色；甲烷在空气中燃烧火焰呈______色。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715312, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 26}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【答案】<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S107.png' /><br>【考情点拨】本题考查了电解质的电离与水解的知识点。<br>【应试指导】盐酸(HC1)是强酸，全部电离，酸性最强；NH<sub>4</sub>Cl是强酸弱碱盐，水解呈酸性，酸性比盐酸弱得多；K<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub>是强酸强碱盐，不水解，溶液呈中性；CH<sub>3</sub> COONa是强碱弱酸盐，水解，溶液呈碱性。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715313, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题二", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 3, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 3, "source": "模拟题二", "starCount": 0, "title": "四种相同物质的量浓度的HCl、NH<sub>4</sub>Cl、CH<sub>3</sub>COONa、K<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub>溶液，其中pH值最大和最小的两种溶液发生反应的离子方程式为______。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715313, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 27}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【答案】<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S108.png' /><br>【考情点拨】本题考查了离子化合物的电子式的知识点。<br>【应试指导】由题意可得Y是+2价的金属，Y与Z原子核外电子数之和为29。故可推得Y为Mg、Z为C1。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715314, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题二", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 3, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 3, "source": "模拟题二", "starCount": 0, "title": "元素Y、Z的原子序数都小于18,1mo1的Y单质与足量HCl反应，生成22.4L(标准状况下)氢气。元素Y与Z原子核外电子数之和为29。元素Y和Z相互作用形成化合物的电子式为______。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715314, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 28}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S109.png' />", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715315, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "计算题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题二", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 11, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 11, "source": "模拟题二", "starCount": 0, "title": "(12分)如图所示，光滑水平地面上的长木板B,其质量M=8kg,质量为m=2kg的小物块A以v<sub>0</sub>=10m/s的初速度滑上木板B,已知A、B间动摩擦因数μ=0.4，求：小物块A的最终速度及A在B上滑行的距离。（设B足够长，取g=10m/s<sup>2</sup>)<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S88.png' />", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715315, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 29}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "a下滑h过程中机械能守恒：<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S110.png' /><br>α进入磁场后，回路中产生感应电流，a、b都受安培力作用，a减速，b加速，经一段时间，a、b达到共同速度v,感应电流为零，安培力为零，共同速度v即为a、b的最终速度，过程中a、b系统所受合外力为零，<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S111.png' />", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715316, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "计算题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题二", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 12, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 12, "source": "模拟题二", "starCount": 0, "title": "(11分)如图所示，金属杆a从高为h处从静止开始沿弧形轨道下滑。导轨平行的水平部分有竖直向下的匀强磁场B,水平部分导轨上原来放有一长L的金属杆b。已知a杆的质量m<sub>1</sub>,且与b杆的质量之比m<sub>1</sub>:m<sub>2</sub>=3:4,水平导轨足够长。两棒始终没有相碰，不计摩擦。求：a和b的最终速度分别是多大？<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S89.png' />", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715316, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 30}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "根据化学反应方程式，设生成气体的体积为V,生成NaOH的物质的量为x。<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S112.png' /><br>答：标准状况下生成气体的体积为560mL,反应后溶液中溶质的物质的量浓度为0.5mol/L。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715317, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "计算题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题二", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 10, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 10, "source": "模拟题二", "starCount": 0, "title": "(10分)1.15g金属钠跟水反应后，得到100mL溶液，试计算：<br>(1)生成的气体在标准状况下是多少毫升？<br>(2)反应后所得溶液的物质的量浓度是多少？", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715317, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 31}], "SimExamStore": {"ExerNum": 31, "CourseId": "H011701", "ExamTime": 150, "ExerSortType": 1, "ScoringMethod": 1, "TotalScore": 150, "SimType": "模拟题", "ExamName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题二"}, "simId": 21626}